resources.string:
The Gazelle is a French reconnaissance helicopter.
The Gazelle helicopter is an aircraft capable of providing air-to-air defense against slow aircraft or
helicopters for ground or airmobile units.
Weapons: HOT missile (range 4000m); GATLING system (M134) on side; Autonomous system powered by battery consisting of 6 barrels and 6 rotating bolts;
Caliber: 7.62 mm; Transport of shooters with STRIKE arm and rifles type Barrett / Hecate / Sako / HK 417.
Armored floors and seats (up to 7.62 mm caliber);
Crew: 1 aircraft commander and 1 pilot;
Endurance: 2h40.
